The following list contains every (assuming I didn't miss any)
adjustment that you get to an exercise check. If an item is followed
by an ('<string>') it means that the message will be shown when the
adjustment is made (this is to help you identify the adjustments).

Disclaimer: I checked all this by reading the source code. I have not
            tried any of these in a 'real life' situation.

Some notes:
 - First exercise check is at 600 moves. After that at intervals varying
   from 200 to 1000 moves (random).
 - While polymorphed you can only exercise in Wis.
 - Doing multiple commands somehow affects all this.
 - No stat can be exercised to be above 18
 - You can do things like 'read empty scroll' unlimited number
   of times.
 - Don't let this worry your game play too much, this list is something
   that you should be able to guess by yourself. I just started doing
   this so I thought I'd finish this.
 - There are 219 exercise adjustment checks in the code.

